      "text": "You need help.\n\n\nMary L Trump (@MaryLTrump)\n\nSo weird Donald didn't stand up, ask for his shoes, defiantly raise his fist, and say \"Fight, fight, fight.\"\n\n\n\n\u2014 https://nitter.net/MaryLTrump/status/2048209143278776358#m",
