    {
      "voiceId": "patrick-bet-david",
      "voiceName": "Patrick Bet-David",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "I have two thoughts:\n\n1.  How the hell did the shooter get in WHCD?\n\n2.  What needs to happen to those who keep inciting violence?  \n\nThere needs to be some accountability taken before it's too late.  \n\nThe indictment of SPLC is a good start but we got work to do.",
