      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "patrick-bet-david",
      "voiceName": "Patrick Bet-David",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Constant surveillance?   \n\nAn absolute Terrible idea.\n\n\nPubity (@pubity)\n\nEvery new car in the U.S. will be required by law to have tech that puts constant surveillance on the driver by 2027.\n\nAI in your car will determine if you're sober and fit to drive, automatically turning off the vehicle if it determines you're a danger on the road.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\u2014 https://nitter.net/pubity/status/2047994026029433116#m",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/patrickbetdavid/status/2048136933801337165",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-25T20:27:52+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "patrick-bet-david",
      "voiceName": "Patrick Bet-David",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Atrophy is the wasting away of a muscle, tissue, or organ due to lack of usage. \n\nThis applies to our brain as much as it does to our physical body. \n\nLearn on your own creativity first before jumping on ChatGPT or perplexity. \n\nDon\u2019t let your most important muscle \ud83e\udde0 atrophy.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/patrickbetdavid/status/2048132371736658377",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-25T20:09:44+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "patrick-bet-david",
      "voiceName": "Patrick Bet-David",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Great leaders don\u2019t avoid conflicts, they manage it.\n\nConflict is inevitable. In life, in business and in the arena you compete in.  \n\nChoose and learn to confront respectfully.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/patrickbetdavid/status/2048061973271880143",
